6883	
6884	## Installation Guide
6885	
6886	### Claude Desktop
6887	
6888	Open Claude Desktop's configuration file (claude_desktop_config.json) and add the following:
6889	
6890	- Mac/Linux: 
6891	```json
6892	{
6893	  "mcpServers": {
6894	    "numpy_mcp": {
6895	      "command": "npx",
6896	      "args": [
6897	        "-y",
6898	        "@smithery/cli@latest",
6899	        "run",
6900	        "@Aman-Amith-Shastry/scientific_computation_mcp",
6901	        "--key",
6902	        "<YOUR_SMITHERY_API_KEY>"
6903	      ]
6904	    }
6905	  }
6906	}
6907	```
6908	
6909	- Windows:
6910	```json
6911	{
6912	  "mcpServers": {
6913	    "numpy_mcp": {
6914	      "command": "cmd",
6915	      "args": [
6916	        "/c",
6917	        "npx",
6918	        "-y",
6919	        "@smithery/cli@latest",
6920	        "run",
6921	        "@Aman-Amith-Shastry/scientific_computation_mcp",
6922	        "--key",
6923	        "<YOUR_SMITHERY_API_KEY>"
6924	      ]
6925	    }
6926	  }
6927	}
6928	```
6929	
6930	Or alternatively, run the following command:
6931	```commandline
6932	npx -y @smithery/cli@latest install @Aman-Amith-Shastry/scientific_computation_mcp --client claude --key <YOUR_SMITHERY_API_KEY>
6933	```
